  SEQNBR  MEMBER      ....+....1....+....2....+....3....+....4....+....5....+....6....+....7....+....8
  000100              .* Rendering: a help module long enough to page, with every block kind.
  000200              :PNLGRP.
  000300              :CLASS NAME=NAMECL BASETYPE='CHAR 10'.
  000400              :ECLASS.
  000500              :VAR NAME=WNAME CLASS=NAMECL VALUE='GADGET'.
  000600              :KEYL NAME=KEYS.
  000700              :KEYI KEY=ENTER ACTION=ENTER.
  000800              :KEYI KEY=F3 ACTION=EXIT.F3=Exit
  000900              :EKEYL.
  001000              :PANEL NAME=DUMMY KEYL=KEYS HELP=HLPWDG.Widgets
  001100              :TEXT DEPTH=2.
  001200              A panel so the group has one.
  001300              :ETEXT.
  001400              :EPANEL.
  001500              :HELP NAME=HLPWDG.Widgets - Help
  001600              :P.The Work with Widgets panel lists the widgets of a library and lets
  001700              you change, remove, show and describe them. Type an option next to an
  001800              entry and press Enter; the option runs for every entry you marked, in
  001900              the order of the list.
  002000              :H1.How to pick an entry
  002100              :P.Type the option number in the Opt column of the entry. To run the
  002200              same option for several entries, type it next to each of them. The
  002300              cursor's entry is &WNAME. when nothing is typed.
  002400              :P.To run a command instead, type it on the command line and press
  002500              Enter.  For help on a command, type its name and press F4 (Prompt).
  002600              :H2.Options
  002700              :UL.
  002800              :LI.Change: the change panel for the entry.
  002900              :LI.Remove: the entry is removed after you confirm.
  003000              :LI.Show: the display panel for the entry.
  003100              :EUL.
  003200              :H2.Keys
  003300              :DL.
  003400              :DT.F5
  003500              :DD.Refreshes the list from the library.
  003600              :DT.F11
  003700              :DD.Shows the quantities instead of the text.
  003800              :EDL.
  003900              :NT.Options you type stay on the panel until they run.
  004000              :ENT.
  004100              :H2.Examples
  004200              :XMP.
  004300                2  GADGET     QGPL
  004400                4  SPROCKET   QGPL
  004500              :EXMP.
  004600              :P.Marking :HP2.two:EHP2. entries runs both options when you press Enter.
  004700              See :LINK PERFORM='DSPHELP HLPMORE'.more about widgets:ELINK. for the rest.
  004800              :PARML.
  004900              :PT.LIB
  005000              :PD.The library whose widgets are listed.
  005100              :EPARML.
  005200              :OL.
  005300              :LI.First step.
  005400              :LI.Second step.
  005500              :EOL.
  005600              :P.The last paragraph ends the module after the page break.
  005700              :EHELP.
  005800              :HELP NAME=HLPMORE.More About Widgets
  005900              :P.Widgets hold other widgets when their holds flag is on.
  006000              :EHELP.
  006100              :EPNLGRP.

